{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/menu_neu2.png?t=1749663283\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wizzo Popout</strong> is a fast-paced 3D <strong>top-down arena shooter</strong> for up to 4 players.  Cast cool spells, dodge enemy blasts, and knock your rivals out of the arena in hilariously <strong>chaotic battles</strong>. Play as an arcane wizzo riding a bouncing magical bubble! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/WhatsPoppin_.png?t=1749663283\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/quad_heads_vert_1_.png?t=1749663283\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put on the hat of a magical, mystical wizzo and show off your <strong>bubble</strong> <strong>blowing skills</strong> against your friends. <strong>Damage</strong> your opponents, but watch out: The higher the damage, the more you'll be <strong>knocked back</strong>! Impress with sickening <strong>flicks</strong> or precicse remote <strong>detonations</strong>. Play your opponents <strong>dizzy</strong>\u00a0with the power of the <strong>dash</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/Couch_Chaos.png?t=1749663283\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outplay your friends in quick and intense, blood rushing battles for <strong>2-4 players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note: To ruin friendships you need friends to begin with.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/GAMING2.png?t=1749663283\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/Worldwide.png?t=1749663283\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieve World Domination in <strong>Online-Multiplayer</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easily create a lobby and invite your friends to play from <strong>anywhere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/WORLDWIDE2.png?t=1749663283\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/SpellCollection__1_.png?t=1749663283\" />\u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Combine two <strong>spells</strong> to create a chaos inflicting <strong>loadout</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/MeeTheSpells__1_.png?t=1749663283\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/BackgroundCapNew.png?t=1749663283\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670670?t=1749663283","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/e74596a3fc1c3e55da619c9011904ad7aaeb5e08/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749663283","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/c979e0c78f5feb9126252cee7f08d4ede4ad8ad7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749663283","cap